#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:827
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Interesting points in the area"
msgstr "Endroits intéressants dans la région"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:832
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "You may be interested in one or more of these:"
msgstr "Vous pourriez être intéressé par un ou plusieurs d'entre eux :"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:835
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "City"
msgstr "City"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:839
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"The City station represents one of the most developed stations in the area. "
"Correlating the station to olde Earth, this would be where the walled "
"medieval area of London would have been located"
msgstr ""
"La station City (La Ville) représente l'une des gares les plus développées "
"de la région. En corrélant la station à l'ancienne Terre, ce serait "
"l'endroit où la zone médiévale fortifiée de Londres aurait été située."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:844
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "Change"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:848
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"Much of the area's financial business is handled at the station named "
"Change. The station name is an oblique reference to the Royal Exchange of "
"London"
msgstr ""
"Une grande partie des affaires financières de la région est gérée à la "
"station nommée Change. Le nom de la station est une référence au Royal "
"Exchange de Londres."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:854
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Foundling"
msgstr "Foundling"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:859
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"Foundling station specializes in medical research for children. The station "
"name honors Foundling Hospital in London, an orphanage established in 1739 "
"by Captain Thomas Coram, a retired seaman"
msgstr ""
"La station Foundling (Enfant Trouvé) est spécialisée dans la recherche "
"médicale pour les enfants. Le nom de la station rend hommage au Foundling "
"Hospital de Londres, un orphelinat créé en 1739 par le capitaine Thomas "
"Coram, un marin à la retraite."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:865
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Thames"
msgstr "Thames"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:869
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"The zone running through this area colored blue is named Thames after the "
"river Thames in London of olde Earth. Ships should avoid entering this "
"zoneexcept by bridges designated due to the adverse effects it has on ship "
"systems. This is why navigation systems automatically show this region for "
"all ships in the area."
msgstr ""
"La zone qui traverse cette bande colorée en bleu est nommée Thames (Tamise) "
"d'après la Tamise de Londres de l'ancienne Terre. Les vaisseaux doivent "
"éviter d'entrer dans cette zone, sauf par les ponts désignés, en raison des "
"effets néfastes qu'elle a sur les systèmes des vaisseaux. C'est pourquoi les "
"systèmes de navigation affichent automatiquement cette région pour tous les "
"vaisseaux de la zone."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:874
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Covent"
msgstr "Covent"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:878
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"Most of the area's food supply comes from station Covent. It specializes in "
"hydroponics. THe station derives its name from Covent Garden from olde Earth "
"London where fruits, vegetables and flowers were bought and sold"
msgstr ""
"La plupart des approvisionnements alimentaires de la région proviennent de "
"la gare de Covent (Couvent). Elle est spécialisée dans la culture "
"hydroponique. La station tire son nom du Covent Garden du vieux Londres de "
"la Terre où les fruits, les légumes et les fleurs étaient achetés et vendus."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:883
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Cheshire"
msgstr "Cheshire"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:887
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"You can find fine dining and drinking at Cheshire station. The name alludes "
"to the Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese pub from London on olde earth"
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez trouver une cuisine et des boissons raffinées à la gare de "
"Cheshire. Le nom fait allusion au pub Ye Olde Cheshire Cheese de Londres sur "
"l'ancienne Terre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:892
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid "Tower"
msgstr "Tower"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:896
msgctxt "areaDescription-comms"
msgid ""
"Station Tower serves as a residence for the wealthiest members of the London "
"area community"
msgstr ""
"La station Tower (La Tour) sert de résidence pour les membres les plus "
"riches de la communauté de la région de Londres."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:909
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1213
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What do you know about unusual readings around here?"
msgstr "Que savez-vous des lectures inhabituelles dans les environs ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:918
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1222
#, fuzzy, lua-format
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"The unusual readings happen in %s. They are sporadic, illogical, and creepy."
msgstr ""
"Des lectures inhabituelles se produisent dans le secteur A2. Elles sont "
"sporadiques, illogiques et effrayantes."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:932
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "You need to stay docked for that action."
msgstr "Vous devez rester amarrés à la station pour cette action."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:941
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in weapons of mass destruction."
msgstr "Nous ne fournissons pas ce type d'arme de destruction massive."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:946
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in weapons of mass disruption."
msgstr "Nous ne fournissons pas ce type d'arme de perturbation massive."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:949
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "We do not deal in those weapons."
msgstr "Nous ne fournissons pas ce type d'arme. Trop dangereux."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:963
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "All nukes are charged and primed for destruction."
msgstr "Toutes les nukes sont chargées et préparées pour la destruction."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:970
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "Sorry, sir, but you are as fully stocked as I can allow."
msgstr ""
"Désolé, officier, mais vous êtes au maximum de ce que vous pouvez stocker."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:977
msgctxt "needRep-comms"
msgid "Not enough reputation."
msgstr "Pas assez de réputation."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:991
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid "You are fully loaded and ready to explode things."
msgstr "Vous êtes chargé au max et prêt à tout faire exploser."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:998
msgctxt "ammo-comms"
msgid ""
"We generously resupplied you with some weapon charges.\n"
"Put them to good use."
msgstr ""
"Nous vous avons généreusement réapprovisionné en munitions.\n"
"Faites-en bon usage."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1011
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"Good day, officer.\n"
"If you need supplies, please dock with us first."
msgstr ""
"Bonjour, officier.\n"
"Si vous souhaitez vous réapprovisionner, veuillez vous amarrer à notre "
"station au préalable."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1018
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid ""
"Greetings.\n"
"If you want to do business, please dock with us first."
msgstr ""
"Salutations.\n"
"Si vous souhaitez faire affaire, merci de vous amarrer à notre station."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1066
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "Can you send a supply drop? (%d rep)"
msgstr "Pouvez-vous nous envoyer une cargaison de ravitaillement ? (%d rep)"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1074
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "You need to set a waypoint before you can request backup."
msgstr ""
"Vous devez définir un marqueur avant de faire une demande de ravitaillement."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1081
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "To which waypoint should we deliver your supplies?"
msgstr "À quel marqueur devons-nous envoyer le ravitaillement ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1087
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1163
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "WP %d"
msgstr "Marqueur %d"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1117
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "We have dispatched a supply ship toward WP %d"
msgstr ""
"Nous venons de déployer un vaisseau qui vous déposera la capsule de "
"ravitaillement au marqueur %d."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1126
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1196
msgctxt "needRep-comms"
msgid "Not enough reputation!"
msgstr "Pas assez de points de réputation !"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1142
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "Please send reinforcements! (%d rep)"
msgstr "Merci de nous envoyer des renforts ! (%d rép)"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1150
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "You need to set a waypoint before you can request reinforcements."
msgstr "Vous devez définir un marqueur avant de demander des renforts."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1157
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "To which waypoint should we dispatch the reinforcements?"
msgstr "À quel marqueur souhaitez-vous recevoir les renforts ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1186
#, lua-format
msgctxt "stationAssist-comms"
msgid "We have dispatched %s to assist at WP %d "
msgstr ""
"Nous venons de déployer le vaisseau de combat %s pour vous soutenir au "
"marqueur %d."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1265
#, lua-format
msgctxt "goal-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Your mission is to protect station Somerset in %s. Other missions may be "
"added. Dock with Somerset for additional mission parameters. Welcome to the "
"London area of human navy influence"
msgstr ""
"Votre mission consiste à protéger la station Somerset située en secteur %s.\n"
"D'autres missions pourront être ajoutées. Amarrez-vous à Somerset pour "
"définir des missions supplémentaires.\n"
"\n"
"Bienvenue dans la zone londonienne sous contrôle de la Marine humaine !"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1275
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1476
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1779
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2097
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2149
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Dock with Somerset"
msgstr "Vous amarrer à Somerset."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1288
#, fuzzy, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "Investigate unusual sensor readings near station Camden in %s"
msgstr ""
"[Ordres en cours]\n"
"Nous avons reçu des lectures inhabituelles de capteurs se trouvant près de "
"la station Camden dans le secteur A2. Pouvez-vous enquêter ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1296
#, fuzzy, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate near station Camden in %s"
msgstr "Enquêter près de la gare de Camden en secteur A2."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1315
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Rusty Chain Link"
msgstr "Des maillons de chaîne rouillés"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1318
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Translucent but glowing rusty chain link"
msgstr "Des maillons de chaîne rouillés translucides mais brillants"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1332
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Jacob Marley] Do you remember your partner from previous missions? "
"Especially the one where Marley station was destroyed? I am doomed to haunt "
"this area of space forever. Take care or suffer the same fate."
msgstr ""
"[Jacob Marley]\n"
"Vous souvenez-vous de votre partenaire qui vous accompagnait lors de vos "
"missions précédentes ? Spécialement celle où la station Marley a été "
"détruite ? Et bien je suis dorénavant voué à hanter cette zone de l'espace "
"pour toujours. Faites attention ou subissez le même sort..."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1446
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Jacob Marley] You must defeat the chains that bind you in the form of "
"Kraylor ships"
msgstr ""
"[Jacob Marley]\n"
"Vous devez vaincre les chaînes qui vous retiennent sous la forme de "
"vaisseaux Kraylors."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1451
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Defeat Kraylors"
msgstr "Éliminer les Kraylors."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1467
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Jacob Marley] Defeating the Kraylors gives you an idea of what is to come. "
"Return to Somerset in %s and prepare for three ghostly visits"
msgstr ""
"[Jacob Marley]\n"
"Vaincre ces Kraylors vous a donné une idée de ce qui vous attend. Retournez "
"à Somerset en secteur %s et préparez-vous pour trois visites fantomatiques..."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1489
#, fuzzy, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"I'm guessing you handled whatever was in %s. Those unusual readings have "
"disappeared. However, we show an unusually high level of chroniton particles "
"near station Millbank in %s. Recommend you investigate."
msgstr ""
"[Ordres en cours]\n"
"Je suppose que vous avez géré tout ce qui se trouvait en secteur A2. Ces "
"lectures inhabituelles ont disparu. Cependant, nous constatons un niveau "
"inhabituellement élevé de particules de chroniton près de la station "
"Millbank en %s. Je vous suggère d'aller enquêter."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1500
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate chroniton particles near station Millbank in %s"
msgstr ""
"Enquêter sur les particules de chroniton près de la station Millbank en "
"secteur %s."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1518
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Tiny escape pod"
msgstr "Petite capsule de sauvetage"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1521
msgctxt "scienceDescription-artifact"
msgid "Tiny escape pod from a previous generation"
msgstr "Petite capsule de sauvetage d'une ancienne génération"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1574
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "Welcome to the Christmases of your past, Scrooge"
msgstr "Bienvenue dans les Noëls de votre passé, équipage du HMS Scrooge."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1673
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "Belle has come. Be sure she makes it to Fezziwig in %s"
msgstr ""
"[Ordres en cours]\n"
"Belle est arrivée. Assurez-vous qu'elle arrive à Fezziwig dans le secteur %s."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1692
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Protect Belle"
msgstr "Protéger Belle."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1757
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"You did not protect Belle, your dearest love. HMS Scrooge experienced "
"catastrophic environmental systems failure due to crew anguish. All of you "
"suffocated."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'avez pas su protéger Belle, votre plus cher amour. Le HMS Scrooge a "
"connu une défaillance catastrophique des systèmes environnementaux en raison "
"de l'angoisse de l'équipage. Vous avez tous suffoqué."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1774
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid "You protected Belle. Somerset awaits"
msgstr ""
"[Ordres en cours]\n"
"Vous avez protégé Belle. Somerset vous attend."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1798
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Our sensors indicated nebulas forming then disappearing. That is impossible, "
"of course. We started level three diagnostics on our sensors to discover "
"what's wrong. Just before starting the diagnostic, we picked up unusual "
"readings near Bedlam in %s. Perhaps you should investigate"
msgstr ""
"[Ordres en cours]\n"
"Nos capteurs nous indiquent que des nébuleuses se forment puis "
"disparaissent. C'est impossible, bien sûr. Nous avons lancé un diagnostic de "
"niveau 3 sur nos capteurs pour découvrir ce qui ne va pas. Juste avant de "
"commencer le diagnostic, nous avons relevé des valeurs inhabituelles près de "
"Bedlam en secteur %s. Vous devriez peut-être enquêter."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1806
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Investigate unusual readings near Bedlam in %s"
msgstr ""
"Enquêter sur les lectures inhabituelles près de Bedlam dans le secteur %s."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1818
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] Happy Christmas, Scrooge! You are just in "
"time to make our holiday bright. I know it is against your nature, but "
"surely you can decorate our skies with alien enemy ship explosions. In the "
"worst case, we will get a sky decorated with your ship exploding."
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit depuis la station Bedlam]\n"
"Joyeux Noël, HMS Scrooge ! Vous êtes arrivé juste à temps pour illuminer nos "
"vacances. Je sais que ce n'est pas dans votre nature, mais vous pouvez "
"sûrement décorer nos cieux avec des explosions de vaisseaux ennemis "
"extraterrestres. Au pire des cas, nous aurions un ciel décoré par "
"l'explosion de votre vaisseau."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1835
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Destroy marauding enemies"
msgstr "Détruire les ennemis qui rôdent."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1887
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit on station Bedlam] I hate to dampen your spirits, but my young "
"maintenance technician, Tim, has become seriously ill. Our medical "
"facilities cannot diagnose, much less treat him. The medical ship Turkey "
"Surprise should be able to help. Could you dock with Bedlam and transport "
"Tim to Turkey Surprise?"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit depuis la station Bedlam]\n"
"Je déteste vous saper le moral, mais mon jeune technicien de maintenance, "
"Tim, est tombé gravement malade. Nos installations médicales ne peuvent pas "
"le diagnostiquer, et encore moins le soigner. Le vaisseau médical Turkey "
"Surprise devrait pouvoir nous aider. Pourriez-vous accoster rapidement à "
"Bedlam et transporter Tim jusqu'au Turkey Surprise ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1905
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Take Tim from Bedlam to Turkey Surprise"
msgstr "Aller chercher Tim à Bedlam et l'emmener à Turkey Surprise."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1916
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"While you fought off the ships near Bedlam, Tiny Tim, Bob Cratchit's "
"maintenance technician perished along with the others aboard station Bedlam. "
"Your engineering crew were so overcome with grief that they neglected a "
"routie maintenance cycle causing engine failure on HMS Scrooge."
msgstr ""
"Pendant que vous combattiez les vaisseaux près de Bedlam, Tiny Tim, le "
"technicien de maintenance de Bob Cratchit a péri avec les autres à bord de "
"la station Bedlam. Votre équipe d'ingénieurs était tellement accablée de "
"chagrin qu'elle a négligé un cycle de maintenance de routine causant une "
"panne de moteur sur le HMS Scrooge."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1934
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. "
"The doctors say he has about %i seconds to live"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"Tim a été transporté à bord du %s. Dépêchez-vous de rejoindre le Turkey "
"Surprise. Les médecins disent qu'il ne lui reste environ que %i secondes à "
"vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1947
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. "
"The doctors say he has about %i minutes to live"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"Tim a été transporté à bord du %s. Dépêchez-vous de rejoindre le Turkey "
"Surprise. Les médecins disent qu'il ne lui reste environ que %i minutes à "
"vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1959
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] Tim has been transported aboard %s. Hurry to Turkey Surprise. "
"The doctors say he has about %i minute to live"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"Tim a été transporté à bord du %s. Dépêchez-vous de rejoindre le Turkey "
"Surprise. Les médecins disent qu'il ne lui reste environ que %i minute à "
"vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1976
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] Please hurry, the doctors say Tim has less than %i seconds to "
"live"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"S'il vous plaît dépêchez-vous, les médecins disent que Tim a moins de %i "
"secondes à vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:1992
#, lua-format
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "[Sick Bay] Tim has less than %i seconds to live"
msgstr ""
"[Infirmerie]\n"
"Tim a moins de %i secondes à vivre."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2008
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2107
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Turkey Surprise] We cannot transport through your shields. Please lower them"
msgstr ""
"[Turkey Surprise]\n"
"Nous ne pouvons pas le transporter à travers vos boucliers. Veuillez les "
"baisser."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2018
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Turkey Surprise] We have transported Tim and our doctors are examining him"
msgstr ""
"[Turkey Surprise]\n"
"Nous avons transporté Tim et nos médecins l'examinent."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2026
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Protect Turkey Surprise"
msgstr "Protéger Turkey Surprise."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2035
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2076
#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2129
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid ""
"Tim dies with Turkey Surprise. %s disabled by a broken heart (engine failure)"
msgstr ""
"Tim meurt à bord du Turkey Surprise. %s s'est désactivé, le cœur brisé "
"(panne moteur)"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2048
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Tim dies. %s disabled by a broken heart (engine failure)"
msgstr "Tim meurt. %s s'est désactivé, le cœur brisé (panne moteur)"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2061
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] Turkey Surprise tells me Tim is doing fine. In fact, he's "
"ready to return to duty. We need him here for critical repairs. Would you "
"bring him home, please?"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"Turkey Surprise nous informe que Tim va bien. En fait, il est même prêt à "
"reprendre du service. Nous avons besoin de lui ici pour des réparations "
"critiques. Voudriez-vous le ramener à la maison, s'il vous plaît ?"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2069
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Return Tim to Bedlam"
msgstr "Ramener Tim à Bedlam."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2090
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob Cratchit] We are so glad Tim is better. He serves a critical role here. "
"Somerset is looking for you"
msgstr ""
"[Bob Cratchit]\n"
"Nous sommes tellement heureux que Tim aille mieux. Il joue ici un rôle "
"essentiel.\n"
"Au fait, Somerset vous cherche."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2117
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Transporter Room] Tim has been transported aboard. Bedlam is wating for us "
"to bring him back to work on repairs"
msgstr ""
"[Salle de téléportation]\n"
"Tim a été transporté à bord. Bedlam attend qu'on le ramène afin qu'il se "
"remette au travail sur les réparations."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2155
#, lua-format
msgctxt "ordersAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"We are glad you took care of those Ghosts in the machine. They came out of "
"nowhere! We still saw some impossible sensor readings even after our sensor "
"overhaul. We are now conducting a level 5 diagnostic and repair regimen. "
"Keep an eye on the City in %s"
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes heureux que vous ayez pris soin de ces Fantômes dans la machine. "
"Ils sont sortis de nulle part ! Nous avons encore vu des lectures de capteur "
"impossibles même après la révision de nos capteurs. Nous menons actuellement "
"un programme de diagnostic et de réparation de niveau 5. Gardez un œil sur "
"la ville en %s."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2163
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid "Watch the City in %s"
msgstr "Jeter un oeil à City (La Ville) en secteur %s."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2237
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "Face your future"
msgstr "Affrontez votre avenir."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2450
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "You have faced your future"
msgstr "Vous avez affronté votre avenir."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2476
msgctxt "return-shipLog"
msgid "Dock at Somerset for a well deserved Christmas break"
msgstr "Amarrez-vous à Somerset pour une pause de Noël bien méritée."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2492
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Jacob Marley] Good to see you spreading joy and easing pain, Scrooge"
msgstr ""
"[Jacob Marley] C'est bon de vous voir répandre la joie et soulager la "
"douleur, HMS Scrooge."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2510
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"May the shadows of the things that have been continue to remind you of the "
"joy of Christmas"
msgstr ""
"Que les ombres des choses qui ont été continuent de vous rappeler la joie de "
"Noël."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2528
msgctxt "return-shipLog"
msgid ""
"Despite Ignorance and Want, prisons and workhouses, know each day fully and "
"celebrate it, especially Christmas"
msgstr ""
"Malgré l'ignorance et le désir, les prisons et les maisons de correction, "
"vivez pleinement chaque journée et célébrez-là, en particulier Noël."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2545
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Urchin Express]\n"
"Happy Christmas, sir!\n"
"Top o' the day to ya!\n"
"Thanks for the shillings!"
msgstr ""
"[Urchin Express]\n"
"Joyeux Noël, monsieur !\n"
"Joyeux Noël à vous !\n"
"Merci pour les shillings !"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2563
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Fred from QE17] Merry Christmas, uncle! Stop by and share Christmas dinner "
"with us when you're off duty"
msgstr ""
"[Fred de QE17] Joyeux Noël, mon oncle ! Faites donc une halte et partagez le "
"dîner de Noël avec nous lorsque vous aurez fini votre service."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2581
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid ""
"[Bob on Cratchit Cruiser] Happy Christmas, Mr. Scrooge. Thanks for the raise "
"and for helping Tiny Tim"
msgstr ""
"[Bob à bord du Cratchit Cruiser] Joyeux Noël, équipage du HMS Scrooge. Merci "
"pour avoir aidé le petit Tim."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2599
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Tim on Cratchit Cruiser] God bless us every one"
msgstr "[Tim sur Cratchit Cruiser] Que Dieu nous bénisse tous."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2618
msgctxt "returnAudio-shipLog"
msgid "[Tim on Cratchit Cruiser] Give me some freakin' eggnog"
msgstr "[Tim sur Cratchit Cruiser] Donne-moi un maudit lait de poule."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2630
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Merry Christmas!"
msgstr "Joyeux Noël !"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2784
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "How dare you bring us here!"
msgstr "Comment osez-vous nous amener ici !"

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2798
msgctxt "audio-shipLog"
msgid "Silence! Since we are here, let us destroy Somerset"
msgstr "Silence ! Puisque nous sommes ici, détruisons Somerset."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2845
msgctxt "shipLog"
msgid "Dock with Graveyard, Cemetery and Necropolis."
msgstr "Amarrez-vous aux stations Graveyard, Cemetery and Necropolis."

#: scripts/scenario_19_what_the_dickens.lua:2863
#, lua-format
msgctxt "msgMainscreen"
msgid "Somerset destroyed. %s dishonored and meaner. Christmas is ruined"
msgstr "Somerset a été détruite. Déshonneur sur le minable %s. Noël est gâché"
